# Phase 5: Metrics Engine

## Goal

Generate participation metrics automatically.

---

## Deliverables

### Word Count

Calculate:

```text
Total words
```

---

### Turn Count

Calculate:

```text
Non-empty lines
```

---

### Average Words Per Turn

Formula:

```text
Word Count / Turn Count
```

Rounded:

```text
2 Decimal Places
```

---

### Automatic Recalculation

Trigger when:

```text
Transcript Generated
Transcript Edited
Transcript Submitted
```

---

## Exit Criteria

✅ Metrics generated

✅ Metrics updated automatically

